Package: com.quan.readerlock
Name: ReaderLock
Version: 0.1.9
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: One-tap reader appliance for Apple Books or MapleRead SE, with Mono/Color controls, notification suppression, an app-launch firewall, authenticated exit, and fail-open recovery. Wi-Fi and cellular stay available. While reading, Powercuff is set to Heavy and Low Power Mode is on; both are restored on exit. The system status bar is hidden and a bottom line shows the time, Wi-Fi, and battery. An open book's own top strip is collapsed, and its progress text stays above that line.
Maintainer: Quân / OpenAI-assisted prototype
Author: Quân / OpenAI-assisted prototype
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), mobilesubstrate, com.opa334.ccsupport
